Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.46,0:00:05.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早安   嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Morning. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.75,0:00:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚约会还顺利吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi! Oh, How was your date last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很不错  太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pretty good. Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:14.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  我真的很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aah! My God. Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事  真的是太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.10,0:00:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了  我要迟到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway I gotta go. I'm late for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.85,0:00:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊  你要把她丢给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What-what?! You're going to leave this person with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心  她真的很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Don't worry, she's a terrific girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能帮我一个忙吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And hey listen, could you do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:30.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她出来了  你能跟她说我不想定下来吗   谢谢你啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When she comes out could you just mention that I'm not looking for a serious relationship? That'd be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.74,0:00:32.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你在开玩笑吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why?! What, are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.78,0:00:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不经意跟她提起这件事  装做轻描淡写的样子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just casually slip it in, you know. Lay the groundwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.45,0:00:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉她我是个独行侠  不  我是爱的逃犯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tell her uh, I'm a loner. No, an outlaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.95,0:00:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她不会想跟我这种人混在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}she doesn't want to get mixed up with the likes of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.25,0:00:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太复杂了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know what? That's a lot to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.87,0:00:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能直接告诉她你是猪吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can't I tell her that you're a pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.71,0:00:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会找时间亲自打电话给她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, I'm gonna call her later myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.21,0:00:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.67,0:00:54.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德以前常这么做  他还会做煎饼给她吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh come on, Chandler used to do it. He'd even make the girl pancakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.97,0:00:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他还会多做几块留给我吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Plus, He'd make extras and leave them for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.14,0:01:01.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了吧   我什么都不会告诉她   这不是我的责任\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well forget it, I'm not telling that girl anything. It's not my responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.60,0:01:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.14,0:01:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些煎饼怎么办啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, where did we land on those pancakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.44,0:01:11.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.82,0:01:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉   我没办法把门锁上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry about that, but I couldn't get that lock to work on the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.24,0:01:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  我搬进来时  乔伊就把它弄坏了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, Joey kind of disabled it when I moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.99,0:01:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定是瑞秋  我是艾玲  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You must be Rachel. I'm Erin. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.41,0:01:26.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想跟高中女生一样无聊   但他有跟你谈到我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't mean this to sound like high school, but did he say anything about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.71,0:01:31.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要吃煎饼吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would you like some pancakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.96,0:01:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记   第七季  第7集  罗斯的博士论文\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S07E07  The One With Ross's Book
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.97,0:01:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.31,0:01:44.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.60,0:01:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.32,0:01:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.69,0:01:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.11,0:02:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.58,0:02:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（大学图书馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.38,0:02:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快说吧  我们为什么要来这里   好吧  猜下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on. Why are we here? Okay, okay, take a guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.76,0:02:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里有辣妹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The hot chicks?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.89,0:02:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  之前我将一些名字输入图书馆的电脑里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, okay, I was typing names into the library computer earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.14,0:02:26.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的  当时只是为了好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you know, for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.02,0:02:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我输入我的名字   你猜我发现了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I typed mine in, and guess what came up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.02,0:02:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的博士论文\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My doctoral dissertation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.11,0:02:36.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它就放在大学中最大的图书馆里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's here! Yeah, It's right down here in the biggest library in the university.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.40,0:02:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  那真的很酷  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, that's actually pretty cool. yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.66,0:02:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里还收藏了一本书   作者是叫做温蒂巴琴娜的女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's also a book here by a woman named Wendy Bagina.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是怎么一回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.33,0:02:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来这两个家伙   真的很喜欢杜威十进分类法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sounds like two people are really enjoying the Dewey decimal system.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:03:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们真的很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.64,0:03:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会是带我来这里做那档子事吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You didn't bring me here to do that, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.90,0:03:14.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她又把鸡肉退回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She sent the chicken back again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.86,0:03:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说鸡肉太干  想亲自跟你解释  她要什么样的鸡肉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She said it's too dry now and she wants to come back here and explain to you how she wants it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.24,0:03:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我倒想会会这个鸡肉专家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well fine! I'd like to meet this chicken expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.78,0:03:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫她进来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Send the colonel in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.16,0:03:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.29,0:03:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幸运的混蛋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Lucky bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.55,0:03:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,珍妮丝  你好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Janice. How are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.67,0:03:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高级大餐厅里   处理上等鸡肉的辣妹大厨师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Ms. Hotshot-Chef-at-the-Big-Fancy Restaurant-With-the-Best-Chicken-Ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.64,0:03:49.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.43,0:03:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你手上戴了什么   我看不见了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, what is that on your finger? I'm blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.56,0:03:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁是那个幸运的男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So who's the lucky guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.99,0:04:03.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.74,0:04:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很抱歉   甜心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am so sorry, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.33,0:04:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.37,0:04:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有告诉她  我们将会结婚吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You didn't tell her we were getting married, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.41,0:04:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她看到戒指了  她被吓到了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She saw the ring. Did she freak out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.13,0:04:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的确被吓了一大跳   但很多人都吓了一大跳\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She was shocked when I told her, but then again, so were most people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.55,0:04:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肯定啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.34,0:04:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上她也交了男朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, She actually has a boyfriend y'know herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.38,0:04:24.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他叫做克拉克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Name's Clark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.14,0:04:27.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她还邀请自己来参加我们的婚礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She also invited herself to our wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.10,0:04:29.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有克拉克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Clark too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.64,0:04:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你拒绝了她吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You said no, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.02,0:04:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你拒绝了她吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You said no, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.32,0:04:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她逼得我头晕  还质问我  婚礼是不是在城里举行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, she cornered me. She asked me if the wedding was in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.70,0:04:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该怎么办   说谎骗她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, What was I supposed to do? Lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.03,0:04:48.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那会有多难呢  "你的支票寄出去了"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How hard is that? "Your check's in the mail."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.62,0:04:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"你的宝宝好可爱"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Oh, your baby's so cute."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.83,0:04:55.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"我等不及要看你的书  罗斯"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"I can't wait to read your book, Ross."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.25,0:05:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她会来参加婚礼  或许并不是件坏事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on! So she comes to the wedding. Maybe it won't be so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.30,0:05:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为她会安静地坐着   你不认为她会想举杯致词吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you think she'll sit quietly? You don't think she'll want to make a toast?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.38,0:05:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不认为她会想唱 《兼职情人》吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't think she'll want to grab the microphone and sing "Part-Time Lover"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.89,0:05:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊   她不会喜欢鸡肉  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. She's not gonna like the chicken that night either, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.81,0:05:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  一定会没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许她根本不想来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know what? She's probably not gonna even want to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.73,0:05:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗   不   那是个谎言\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? No, that was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.61,0:05:26.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道说谎有多容易了吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See how easy that was?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.53,0:05:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你会骗她吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you would have just lied?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.66,0:05:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.33,0:05:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它真的就那么简单   对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It would have really been that easy? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.42,0:05:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  那星期六表演给我看  我们要跟她和克拉克共进晚餐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good, so do it Saturday night because we're going to dinner with her and Clark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.88,0:05:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们还好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.18,0:05:52.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   你的朋友是谁啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, who's your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.77,0:05:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.85,0:05:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨   乔伊   艾玲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Joey. Erin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.77,0:05:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.65,0:06:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们整天泡在一起   玩得很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, We ended up spending the day together and had such a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.90,0:06:07.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那当然   艾玲真的很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why wouldn't you? Erin is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.95,0:06:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then there's you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.49,0:06:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我得走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, listen, I better get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.95,0:06:15.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天真的很愉快   谢谢  我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Today was great. Thanks. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.66,0:06:16.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.91,0:06:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊   昨晚真的很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And Joey, last night was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.58,0:06:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊   我再打电话给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I'll call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.17,0:06:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也会打电话给你   我会打电话给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll call you too. Or I'll call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打电话给我   好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And call me. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.76,0:06:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴能再见到你  拜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good to see you again. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.43,0:06:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bye-bye. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.97,0:06:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那套系统已经崩溃了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So the system kind of broke down, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.93,0:06:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  对不起  我没办法告诉她那些话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh Joey, I'm sorry. I just couldn't tell her all those things you wanted me to tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.53,0:06:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们开始聊起天来  我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And y'know we got to talking, and I--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.77,0:06:43.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要你娶她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We want you to marry her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.69,0:06:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.94,0:06:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她真的很棒   你根本不了解她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She is so amazing. You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.65,0:06:50.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不了解   你觉得是谁把她带回来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No idea? Who do you think brought her here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.78,0:06:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丘比特\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她真的好酷   还会说四种语言\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, she's so cool. She speaks four languages.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.00,0:07:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊   你们真的知道男人想要什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man, do you know what guys want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.13,0:07:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样   她跟你是天生的一对   她真的很漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look Joey, Come on, she's so perfect for you. I mean She's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.76,0:07:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她喜欢棒球   午餐时喝了两瓶啤酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She likes baseball. She had two beers at lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.26,0:07:11.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的啤酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My beers?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.43,0:07:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着   她真的是个好女孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look you guys, she's a very nice girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.47,0:07:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们相处甚欢   但我不觉得我们会有什么结局\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. We had a very good time, but I just I don't see it going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.73,0:07:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你总是那么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, but you always say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.35,0:07:23.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许只要你给她一次机会   事情就会变得不一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe if you gave this girl a chance, it would go somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.44,0:07:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我真的不那么认为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look I'm sorry, you guys. I just don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.90,0:07:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随便你  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whatever. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.90,0:07:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  别开始评论我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, don't start judging me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.03,0:07:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你爱上了你的助理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're the one who's in love with your assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.53,0:07:38.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有你  你跟在屋顶上养鸽子的男人有一腿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Huh? And you, You're the one having the affair with the guy who keeps pigeons on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.87,0:07:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.37,0:07:42.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是秘密恋情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Secret affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.67,0:07:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.22,0:07:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家在我的书面前做那档子事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}People are doing it in front of my book.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.76,0:07:57.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.14,0:08:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,学校图书馆收藏了我的博士论文   我跑过去看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My doctoral dissertation is in the library at school. I went to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发现学生们在古生物学区 "做那档子事"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And there were students making babies right in the middle of the paleontology section.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.65,0:08:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊   你有看到精彩好戏吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. Did you get to see anything good?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.03,0:08:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我问问  你们念书的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me ask you something, at your school...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.49,0:08:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,校园里有没有什么地方  是学生会跑去鬼混的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...was there a like uh a place on campus where students went to fool around?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.95,0:08:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  真的有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, there was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,图书馆的角落里  有些书根本不会有人去借\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was—there the corner of the library where all these dusty books that nobody ever read.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.04,0:08:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  是那里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, there was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  因为大家都会跑到那里去  像是秘密基地一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great, because people kept showing up. I think it's like a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.88,0:08:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是指五楼后区的墙边吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fifth floor, against that back wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.81,0:08:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的老天爷啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, for crying out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.94,0:08:47.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们该去看电影了  干嘛这么急\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, So we should go catch our movie. Well now what's the rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.69,0:08:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想看预告片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd like to see the previews.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.28,0:08:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想吃糖果\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.20,0:08:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  看看是谁来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey. Well, look who's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.82,0:08:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨   乔伊   嗨  艾玲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Joey. Hey, Erin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.54,0:09:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨   瑞秋  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rachel. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.99,0:09:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们正要去看电影\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We were  just about to take off and see a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.21,0:09:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  不  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.63,0:09:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我们忘了  我们得去参加派对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, we forgot that party we have to go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.05,0:09:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  不会吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.93,0:09:15.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么派对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What party?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.26,0:09:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生日派对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A birthday party.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁的生日派对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whose birthday party?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.89,0:09:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爱莉森的生日派对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Alison's birthday party.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爱莉森几岁了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. And how old is Alison?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.19,0:09:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三十二岁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thirty-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下   你们为什么不一起出去玩呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute. Why don't you guys do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.61,0:09:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一招还真的有用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, Look how that worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我是学校里的教授\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me. Hi, I'm a professor here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.75,0:09:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道五楼437号书架的古生物学区吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you know the paleontology section, fifth floor, stack 437?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.75,0:09:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  等我五分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, yes. Just give me five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.88,0:09:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得找人来帮我代班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just have to find someone to cover my shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能跟负责人谈一谈吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I speak to someone in charge please?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.56,0:10:10.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.73,0:10:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  我想问馆方能不能增加人手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, I was wondering, if it is possible to increase security...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.36,0:10:16.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巡逻古生物学区\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...in the paleontology section?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.49,0:10:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我写的书放在那里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wrote a book that's up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但大家去那里不是看书  而是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And instead of reading it, people are...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.03,0:10:24.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在我的书面前打滚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, they're rolling around in front of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.25,0:10:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道你提及的问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We are aware of the problem you're referring to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.34,0:10:37.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但增加巡逻这件事   恐怕馆方的人力不足\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But as far as increasing security, I'm afraid the library's very understaffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.30,0:10:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我帮不上你的忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.22,0:10:41.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.93,0:10:44.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我是唯一愿意欣赏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If I'm the only person with any appreciation...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.85,0:10:48.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,书写文字之美的人  我会亲自去捍卫它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...of the sanctity of the written word, then I'll go up there and defend it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.31,0:10:51.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别跟着我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't you follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.32,0:10:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.15,0:10:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟艾玲玩得还开心吗   真是不可思议\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How did it go with Erin? Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.40,0:11:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们玩得非常开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We had the best time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.70,0:11:06.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你不再生我们的气了  不  你们是对的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh so, you're not, you're not mad at us anymore? No, no. You guys were totally right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.37,0:11:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次比我们第一次约会棒得多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is so much better than the first time we went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.83,0:11:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第一次真的很尴尬   我们都很紧张\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know? That was so awkward, We were both nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.63,0:11:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不是上过床了  对  那倒是让我冷静了下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Didn't you sleep together? Yeah, that really calms me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:18.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有很多共通点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And we have so much in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.92,0:11:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她喜欢三明治  运动  虽然她是大都会队的球迷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She loves sandwiches, sports. Although she is a Met fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.51,0:11:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在那都不是问题   但如果我们有了孩子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}not much of an issue now, but if we had kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.22,0:11:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  你竟然会提到生孩子的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! Listen to you talking about having kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.15,0:11:34.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  我的乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.15,0:11:37.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求求你别比我先结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please don't get married before I do. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.70,0:11:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信克拉克会放我鸽子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just cannot believe that Clark stood me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.83,0:11:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他可能还是会来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He may still show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.29,0:11:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是笨蛋吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you, stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.87,0:11:55.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经等了三小时  只有三小时吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's been three hours. Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.29,0:11:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谈一些比较快乐的事吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's go on to happier things. okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.13,0:12:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不告诉我你们的婚礼呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't you tell me about your lovely wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.88,0:12:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关于我们的婚礼  有一件事我们想告诉你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well actually uh, there was something that we wanted to tell you about the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.93,0:12:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,婚礼的规模很小\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's going to be a small ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.44,0:12:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小到不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, Tiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.15,0:12:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们甚至不知道为什么要举行婚礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're not even sure why we're having it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.73,0:12:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上我们只会邀请了家人来参加\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's actually we wants to be just family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.11,0:12:25.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔   等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.87,0:12:29.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们把我当家人看待\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You two think of me as family?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.17,0:12:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得问你们一件事   请老实地回答我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh,  I have to ask you something now, and be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.63,0:12:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们要我唱《无心呢喃》 还是《红衣女郎》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you want me to sing "Careless Whisper" or "Lady in Red"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:46.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么能那么说   大都会队也好不到哪里去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How can you say that? The Mets have no closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.14,0:12:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,班尼提兹呢   第一场比赛呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about Benitez? What about game one of the Series?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不闭嘴   你才要闭嘴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about shut up? You shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.94,0:12:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢跟她吵架\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love arguing with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.31,0:12:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我马上回来  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Be right back. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟乔伊进行得如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So how's it going with Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.36,0:13:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.57,0:13:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.16,0:13:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请告诉我你喜欢他   告诉我你真的喜欢他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait okay, tell me that you like him, please. I mean, tell me that you like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他真的很棒  我知道  你们希望我们能成功\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, he's a really great guy, and I know you really want this to work out...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不觉得我们会有未来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but I just don't see this having a future.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你说过你喜欢他   发生了什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you said that you liked him. I mean what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.59,0:13:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你改变主意了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you just change your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:28.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以那么说   那么快改回来啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kind of. Then change it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.68,0:13:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我们之间真的没有火花\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. It's just there's no real spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.60,0:13:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有火花   你们不是都上过床了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No spark? Didn't you sleep together?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.85,0:13:37.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.31,0:13:38.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,荡妇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh, tramp!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.82,0:13:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does Joey have any idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.61,0:13:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想他不知道   你知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I really I don't think he does. And you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.20,0:13:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你们可以告诉他  我不想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe you guys could help clue him in. Y'know, tell him I'm not interested...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,认真地跟别人交往\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...in a serious relationship or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.45,0:13:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说你是个独行侠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You mean, like, that you're kind of a loner?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:55.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  那个说法不错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, that'd be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你真的是个淫娃   你说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And maybe that you're a real stronzo. I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你会说的四种语言里   不包括意大利语吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh well, I guess Italian isn't one of the four languages you speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.76,0:14:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   要走了吗   对啊  我们走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Want to go? Yeah, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.64,0:14:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,待会见   再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. See you guys later. Bye, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   谢谢你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.77,0:14:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜不是丘比特把她带来这里的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess it wasn't Cupid that brought her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不   只是一个会飞的老矮人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, just a regular old flying dwarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.29,0:14:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了   需要我帮忙吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, yes. How can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.20,0:14:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是四处看看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, we were...we were just looking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来你们是爱念书的学生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you're-you're fellow scholars.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.75,0:14:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们到底在找什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What exactly were you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:44.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你们想看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Perhaps--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.59,0:14:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,查斯特史塔克博士\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Perhaps Dr. Chester Stock's musings...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对剑齿虎的研究\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...on the Smilodon californicus?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.31,0:14:54.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快滚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.11,0:15:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来找人吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Meeting someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.86,0:15:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是你想来看看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or are you just here to brush up...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玛莉安对进化论的看法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...on Merriam's views on evolution?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.03,0:15:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我觉得玛莉安的观点  太先进了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, I find Merriam's views far too progressionist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.25,0:15:24.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也觉得玛莉安的观点太先进了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I find Merriam's views far too progressionist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.79,0:15:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  你是哪位\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.17,0:15:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是本校的教授罗斯盖勒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm a professor here. Ross Geller.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.63,0:15:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯盖勒   为什么那个名字好熟  它是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross Geller? Why do I know that name? It's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.73,0:15:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这本书是你写的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you write this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.90,0:15:43.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.57,0:15:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就是借走我的书的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're the person who checked out my book?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.61,0:15:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我想像中完全不一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, you look nothing like I would have thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.83,0:15:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好年轻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.50,0:16:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我四年级跳级了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I skipped fourth grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.17,0:16:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am very, very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.73,0:16:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.14,0:16:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.31,0:16:28.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的约会还顺利吗  太棒了  我们在格林威治村散步\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So how was your date? Oh, it was great! We walked all around the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.40,0:16:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还去了冰淇淋店  一起喝一杯奶昔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We went to this ice cream place. Split a milk shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.28,0:16:32.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喝的比较多   但还是很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Seventy-thirty, but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.03,0:16:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想带她到北区的民宿去过一夜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And guess what, I'm thinking of taking her upstate to one of those bed-and-breakfasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.99,0:16:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  她答应了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? She said she wants to go away with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.29,0:16:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  那只是个惊喜  但那有点难  因为她说她的工作实在很忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No-no-no-no-no! it's a surprise. but it's gonna be tricky thought because she said she was gonna be pretty busy at work for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.17,0:16:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  甜心  乔伊  我们得谈一谈  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, look, honey, we need to talk, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.92,0:16:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天她让我觉得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got the feeling from her today...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.18,0:16:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她不想认真地跟别人交往\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that she's not looking for a serious relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会那么想   是她告诉我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where are you getting this? She told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.27,0:17:07.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说她是个独行侠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She said she's kind of a loner.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.77,0:17:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.07,0:17:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊   嘿   瑞秋  没关系的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey-Hey, Rach, it's cool, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.58,0:17:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是个独行侠  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm a loner too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.41,0:17:25.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊   你知道吗   她配不上你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Joey. You know what? You are way too good for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.96,0:17:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓下次我会告诉她们   你不想定下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah and honey I promise, next time I will just say good-bye and tell them you're not looking for a relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.30,0:17:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.55,0:17:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不   别那么做   只要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, don't do that. Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.60,0:17:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下次确定她真的喜欢我   对   你说得没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Next time, make sure she really likes me. Well, that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.90,0:17:48.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.52,0:17:50.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.52,0:17:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要吃煎饼吗   终于问我了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you want some pancakes? Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.61,0:17:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们该怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.70,0:18:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们该选《无心呢喃》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I say we go with "Careless Whisper."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.50,0:18:06.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她看到我们了吗  看到我们了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did she see us yet? Did she see us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.34,0:18:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,珍妮丝   你来干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Janice, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.59,0:18:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想回我家去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought I was gonna go back to my apartment...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但今晚我不想独处\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but then I just felt like I really couldn't be alone tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在想或许我可以待在你们家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was just wondering if I could maybe stay here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.36,0:18:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的觉得我该跟家人在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just I really feel like I need to be with family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:42.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的孩子会叫她珍妮丝阿姨  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Our kids are gonna call her Aunt Janice, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.41,0:18:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托   因为我真的不知道   我会做出什么事来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please. Because otherwise, I really don't know what I might do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.87,0:18:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会有点好奇吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aren't you just a teensy bit curious?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.05,0:18:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们有面纸吗   有  在浴室里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have any tissues? Yeah, in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.22,0:19:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得收留她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll just ...we'll just let her stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.18,0:19:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  如果我们收留她  她会永远住在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No-no-no-no, If we let her stay, she will stay forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.60,0:19:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像你的躺椅一样   你真的那么想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kind of like your Barcalounger. Is that what you're thinking about right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.06,0:19:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直都是那么想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I never stop thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.73,0:19:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   两位\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.28,0:19:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们想上洗手间吗   因为我要洗澡了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do either one of you want to get in there before I take my bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,珍妮丝   对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Janice, I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.78,0:19:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但今晚你不能留下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but you can't stay here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.75,0:19:28.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.00,0:19:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实情吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.83,0:19:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们家因为电磁辐射的关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Our apartment is a hotbed...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.29,0:19:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,遭到了污染\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...for electromagnetic activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.67,0:19:41.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡跟我已经免疫了  但不幸地\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica and I have been immunized, but sadly...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.93,0:19:45.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有免疫力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you have not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.23,0:19:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要一条棉被\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna to need a comforter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.02,0:19:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有抗过敏的棉被吗   不然的话我的鼻子会过敏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you have a hypoallergenic one? Because otherwise I get very nasal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.45,0:20:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们养猫了吗   因为我已经开始过敏了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you have a cat? Because it's already happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.53,0:20:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们听到了吗   你们听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Eh. Do you hear that? Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.87,0:20:12.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊   你非离开不可了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! Oh, my God! You have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.46,0:20:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.21,0:20:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为钱德对你还有感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because Chandler still has feelings for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:23.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He does?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.97,0:20:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Say again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.35,0:20:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.89,0:20:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以今晚你不能留下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that is why you can't stay here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.23,0:20:35.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你都不该来参加婚礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And probably why you shouldn't come to the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.23,0:20:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉  很强烈的感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Feelings. Such strong feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.82,0:20:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说我知道他对你的感觉   永远都不会完全消失\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I realize that his feelings may never completely go away...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.87,0:20:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你应该消失\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.04,0:20:51.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.08,0:20:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我懂了  真的很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I understand. I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.92,0:20:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会离开的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.51,0:21:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Goodbye, Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.47,0:21:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我祝你跟他永远幸福快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wish you a lifetime of happiness with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.72,0:21:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.77,0:21:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们相处得不好   就打电话给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You call me when this goes in the pooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.28,0:21:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张  这片区由我来负责\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't sweat it, I've got this section covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.45,0:21:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上我会拿着手电筒   照别人的眼睛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, in fact, I've got this baby to shine in people's eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.66,0:21:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  待会见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.63,0:21:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是带摩妮卡来看你的书\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just wanted to show Monica your book.
